{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2023-03-15 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS TO MANAGE INFRASTRUCTURE PROGRAM FOR FULTON COUNTY SCHOOLS', 'text': "PROGRAM TO REBUILD SCHOOLS, IMPROVE ENERGY EFFICIENCY, SAFETY AND TECHNOLOGY SYSTEMS DALLAS , MARCH 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED BY FULTON COUNTY SCHOOLS (FCS) IN ATLANTA, GEORGIA TO MANAGE THE EDUCATION SPECIAL PURPOSE LOCAL OPTION SALES TAX (ESPLOST) CAPITAL IMPROVEMENT PROGRAM. THE CURRENT PROGRAM WILL IMPLEMENT FCS' CAPITAL PLAN 2027, WHICH INCLUDES $648 MILLION IN CAPITAL IMPROVEMENTS FOR FCS FACILITIES, SAFETY AND TECHNOLOGY SYSTEMS."}